{"sections":[{"slug":"模形式","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"模形式"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">模形式</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“模形式”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">模形式是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆曲线的模叠","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线的模叠</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的某种微分形式</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\mathcal M_{\\text{ell}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆曲线的模叠","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆曲线的模叠</span>"}},{"Plain":", $A \\to \\mathcal M_{\\text{ell}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为万有椭圆曲线</span>, $\\Omega^1_{A/S}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为其上的逐纤维</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kähler微分","text":"Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">微分</span>"}},{"Plain":", $e$ <span lang=\"zh\">为零截面</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> $\\mathcal M_{\\text{ell}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的线丛</span>\n$$\r\n\\omega:=e^*\\Omega^1_{A/S}.\r\n$$\n$k$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶模形式是</span> $\\omega^{\\otimes k}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的截面</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关页面</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谷山–志村猜想","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谷山</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">志村猜想</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}